# Speech-to-text for "คุยกับ Claude AI ผ่าน LINE" voice messages — OpenAI's
# Whisper API (separate provider from ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, since Anthropic's
# Messages API has no audio content-block support). Optional — voice input
# via LINE just replies with a clear Thai error if this isn't set; typed
# text commands work either way.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-openai-api-key
